      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a sci-fi novel about a group of rebels who are trying to overthrow a corrupt galactic empire. im trying to write a manifesto for them that really captures their core values and why they think the old system needs to be completely dismantled. can you help me draft some points for what their new moral code should look like?",
